      "date": "2026-02-17T11:32:59.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹1.60 (vs ₹2.93 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹1.60 (down from ₹2.93 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹242.6m (down 33% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹17.8m (down 45% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 7.3% (down from 9.0% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by lower revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 34% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 18% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
